Subject: [PATCH 2164/3799] soh: rename D_8090709C -> sLimbTrailIndices

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: per-limb index handed to func_808FD080 with unk_424; that function's role is not established, so the trail reading is inferred from its pairing with the sword trail
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
